\ AOT regression test for lib/scanner.1z. Construction-only smoke test:
\ every other scanner word reads through struct fields, which crashes
\ under AOT.
\
\ The construction path still drags scanner's freeze frontend and IR
\ codegen, so backslides on the stack-effect or row-variable surface
\ surface here as a build failure.

use "scanner" ;

"hello" <scanner> drop "constructed" print-line
